{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Majuu Sensen","13 scientists seek to tap genetic powers by creating a hybrid of man and beast. Years later, 13 of their children are embroiled in a battle to undo their handiwork, while Shinichi, the son of one of the scientists, teams up with Christian super-beings to save the world.\n\n\n(Source: Animevice)"],"ja":["魔獣戦線",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-9043","ids":{"shikimori":9043,"mal":9043,"anilist":9043,"kodik":"serial-37226"},"kodikIds":["serial-37226"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-37226":"2021-09-11T04:52:27Z"},"title":"Битва с демонами","originalTitle":"Majuu Sensen","alt":"魔獣戦線 魔獣戦線","description":"Тринадцать учёных используют клеточную и генетическую инженерию, создавая гибрид человека и зверя. Спустя многие годы дети этих учёных втянуты в битву, чтобы спасти мир от искусственно созданных опасных существ. Шиничи, сын одного из учёных, объединяется со сверхсуществами, чтобы они помогли ему в борьбе. Смогут ли потомки учёных исправить ошибки своих родителей и победить в этой неравной битве?","year":1990,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Фантастика"],"rating":6.2,"popularity":873,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/9043/1334e7e9fa4c8eb73dea694843463831.jpeg","width":670,"height":885},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/0a84be15ee994756104fdd116e733415a9dfba09.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-647","dubId":"647","label":"Колобок","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-37226","translationId":"647","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/887460/05bc9e5cf651302f005c3079dee36269/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik